  "claim": "Dollar Days was the sixth track on Bowie's twenty-fifth and final studio album. The album that was released was recorded in secret.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Death of David Bowie. Sentence: On 10 January 2016, English singer, songwriter and actor David Bowie died at his New York City apartment, having suffered from liver cancer for the previous 18 months.\nPage: Death of David Bowie. Sentence: His death occurred two days after the release of his twenty-fifth studio album, \"Blackstar\", which coincided with his 69th birthday.\nPage: Blackstar (album). Sentence: The album was largely recorded in secret between The Magic Shop and Human Worldwide Studios in New York City with Bowie's longtime co-producer Tony Visconti and a group of local jazz musicians.\nPage: Dollar Days. Sentence: It is the sixth track on Bowie's twenty-fifth and final studio album, \"Blackstar\", released on 8 January 2016.",
